%% Settlement and payment paths (INTERNAL)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Completed load
  participant CAR as Carrier
  participant FLT as Fleet Company
  participant DRV as Driver
  Note over CAR: Carrier owns settlement calculation
  L->>CAR: Load revenue attributed
  alt Carrier driver
    CAR->>DRV: Driver settlement (statement + PDF)
  else Managed fleet driver
    CAR->>FLT: Fleet settlement (gross, fees, deductions, escrow, net)
    FLT->>CAR: Acknowledge or dispute
    CAR->>FLT: Approve and pay
    FLT->>DRV: Driver pay (Fleet Company controls)
  end
